**Technique: Scheduled Task/Job: Systemd Timers (T1053.006)**

**Command (bash):**
```
echo "[Unit]" > #{path_to_systemd_service}
echo "Description=Atomic Red Team Systemd Timer Service" >> #{path_to_systemd_service}
